{"id":2568,"date":"2021-04-19T01:43:52","date_gmt":"2021-04-19T01:43:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/?page_id=2568"},"modified":"2023-08-14T11:30:59","modified_gmt":"2023-08-14T11:30:59","slug":"cbd-payment-processing","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/cbd-payment-processing\/","title":{"rendered":"Payment Processing for CBD Merchants"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-1 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0);background-position: center center;background-repeat: no-repeat;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 0px;border-color:#e2e2e2;border-style:solid;\" id=\"sticky-sidebar-container\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start fusion-flex-justify-content-center\" style=\"max-width:1216.8px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-0 fusion_builder_column_2_3 2_3 fusion-flex-column\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\" style=\"background-position:left top;background-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-background-size:cover;-moz-background-size:cover;-o-background-size:cover;background-size:cover;padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-1\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1610562965139 para-black\">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<h2><strong>CBD Merchant Account<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p>This is a booming era for CBD products, but the financial world has been slow to catch up with customer demand. Until just a couple years ago, CBD products were not available per federal law. Although that\u2019s now changed, a stigma still seems to cling to the industry, leading many major merchant processing companies to avoid or penalize CBD sales.<\/p>\n<p>As an entrepreneur with a CBD business, there are trustworthy solutions available that will allow you to safely and successfully connect your customers with the CBD oils, tinctures, lotions, and beauty products that they seek. It doesn\u2019t have to be difficult or expensive to find quality CBD merchant services.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"color--primary\">Choosing the Right CBD Merchant Account<\/h2>\n<p>Look for a credit processing company with a history of success. With CBD as a new industry, new financial institutions are popping up to get involved. When you can\u2019t look back and see a pattern of reliability, you can\u2019t be sure that your credit card processing will stick around for the foreseeable future.<\/p>\n<p>Plus, not every\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/high-risk-merchant-account\/\">high risk merchant account<\/a>\u00a0provider will have your best interests at heart. If it seems too good to be true, with incredibly low rates, the company\u2019s customer service or security might be skimpy. Other providers may instead overcharge CBD merchants, taking unfair advantage of a market with limited options.<\/p>\n<p>There are huge advantages to working with a company that\u2019s familiar with CBD merchants. That\u2019s an instrumental part of our offerings at TailoredPay. We\u2019ve taken the time to evaluate fair rates that help cover any risks and we\u2019ve learned what services are most appreciated by similar companies. Plus, you\u2019ll be able to see what their other customers are saying about the processing provided.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"color--primary\">What Payment Processing Company is Right For My CBD Business?<\/h2>\n<p>So your business needs online credit card processing\u2014how do you find the right company to handle that important task? You\u2019ll want to have a list of important questions prepared. If a website doesn\u2019t cover these, reach out to a promising company\u2019s customer service team to find out if they offer the features you need.<\/p>\n<p>It\u2019s smart to ask\u2026<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Are there setup fees?<\/li>\n<li>What\u2019s the timeframe for getting started?<\/li>\n<li>How many transactions can I complete per month?<\/li>\n<li>Is my account considered high-risk?<\/li>\n<li>How does your system ensure my customers\u2019 financial information remains secure?<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 class=\"color--primary\">Finding a CBD Payment Processor for Shopify<\/h2>\n<p>While Shopify\u2019s terms look a little hazy when it comes to CBD, there are many merchants successfully using this platform to distribute their wares. One thing\u2019s pretty certain, though\u2014you\u2019ll have trouble with payment processing through Shopify\u2019s standard setup.<\/p>\n<p>However, Shopify does permit selling to use a third-party payment processing service. TailoredPay offers this essential\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/\">high risk credit card processing<\/a>\u00a0service so that you don\u2019t have to choose between Shopify and CBD sales.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"color--primary\">Risk Levels for Merchant Processing<\/h2>\n<p>A credit card processing company may be wary of backing ventures that are deemed high risk. There\u2019s an assessment process, similar to the steps a bank would take when you ask for a loan. Certain industries are designated as risky in this realm:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Dating services and adult services<\/li>\n<li>Nutraceutical products such as dietary supplements<\/li>\n<li>Online gambling or casinos<\/li>\n<li>CBD and vape products<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>There are a few different reasons why any one of these areas would be considered risky. First, there\u2019s the subjective factor of reputation. With CBD merchant processing, some financial institutions simply choose to avoid processing \u201ccontroversial\u201d payments.<\/p>\n<p>There\u2019s also the issue of fraud and chargebacks. High risk merchants are more likely to have their charges disputed by customers. The credit card processor then must spend time and money researching the claim and possibly providing a refund.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"color--primary\">Are CBD Merchant Services Expensive?<\/h2>\n<p>There is no reason why it should be prohibitively expensive to run a CBD business. You\u2019ll need to choose your payment processor with care, though.<\/p>\n<p>You don\u2019t want to have your small business\u2019s whole budget planned out and then discover that a hidden fee has wildly changed your month\u2019s earnings. Reputable credit card processors such as TailoredPay want you to succeed, and they will help you do so by answering questions and being upfront about your plan.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"color--primary\">Getting Started with Your Merchant Account<\/h2>\n<p>When you have a great new idea for a business or are ready to grow a small business, TailoredPay is here to help you process credit card payments easily, safely, and affordably. It only takes a few minutes to fill out our online application, so there\u2019s no reason to wait. In fact, we pride ourselves on a fast turnaround time\u2014most approved accounts can start processing their CBD sales in under 72 hours.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><style type=\"text\/css\">.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-0{width:66.666666666667% !important;margin-top : 0px;margin-bottom : 20px;}.fusion-builder-column-0 > .fusion-column-wrapper {padding-top : 0px !important;padding-right : 0px !important;margin-right : 2.88%;padding-bottom : 0px !important;padding-left : 0px !important;margin-left : 2.88%;}@media only screen and (max-width:992px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-0{width:100% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-column-0 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 1.92%;margin-left : 1.92%;}}@media only screen and (max-width:670px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-0{width:100% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-column-0 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 1.92%;margin-left : 1.92%;}}<\/style><\/div><aside class=\"fusion-lay